#X obj 850 706 cnv 1 420 260 empty empty TRY\ THIS 8 12 0 13 #e6f6e9 #1d3557 0;
#X text 860 732 1) Listen to the rhythm: the XOR bell plays exactly when ONE of the two pulses is on. Watch the lights: h1 and h2 are the hidden "feature detectors"., f 56;
#X text 860 783 2) Change h2 into h1 (bias -0.5): both hidden neurons say the same thing and XOR breaks. A hidden layer only helps if its neurons see DIFFERENT things., f 56;
#X text 860 849 3) Inputs level 0 \, XOR tone 0 \, raw 1 - then raise "speed" to 50-200: a ring-modulated 1-bit timbre., f 56;
